# config/ai-packages — packages that make up the optional AI stack (ADR-0002).
#
# `lui ai disable` writes /etc/lui/ai.disabled; `lui sync --system` then skips
# these packages without editing the declarative lists. `lui ai disable --prune`
# removes them explicitly (preview + typed confirmation). `lui ai enable` clears
# the flag and lets the next sync reinstall them.
#
# Weights are NOT packages: see config/models.json and `lui ai sync`.

